    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It is recommended to connect the controller before launching the game.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/f4e024e2427dd6266268f288042f7a16.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a 3D side-scrolling adventure where fierce anthropomorphic animal warriors battle through breathtaking worlds in fast-paced, action-packed combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.poster.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.webm?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.mp4?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a non-plot, purely fun game with many levels, each with a BOSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the BOSS to enter the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.poster.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.webm?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.mp4?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are in side-scrolling combat mode: move left, move right, jump, punch attack, kick attack, dodge, wall jump, and special move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.poster.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.webm?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.mp4?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ape level has nothing to do with racism. They are strong and cool, &quot;We are not monkeys&quot;, meaning we are strong apes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It is recommended to connect the controller before launching the game.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/f4e024e2427dd6266268f288042f7a16.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a 3D side-scrolling adventure where fierce anthropomorphic animal warriors battle through breathtaking worlds in fast-paced, action-packed combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.poster.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.webm?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/cf3054d23396bdd3ffba541c3ffe3413.mp4?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a non-plot, purely fun game with many levels, each with a BOSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the BOSS to enter the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.poster.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.webm?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/d29fd7e037d6bb9096374176037c4d8f.mp4?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are in side-scrolling combat mode: move left, move right, jump, punch attack, kick attack, dodge, wall jump, and special move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.poster.avif?t=1753024231\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.webm?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615920/extras/c6ea9b30839447c5634d23dcbfb8b536.mp4?t=1753024231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ape level has nothing to do with racism. They are strong and cool, &quot;We are not monkeys&quot;, meaning we are strong apes.</p>",
    "short_description": "3D animal anthropomorphic characters, horizontal scrolling, action-adventure game, exciting fighting moves, and gorgeous background images. Controls are in side-scrolling combat mode: move left, move right, jump, punch attack, kick attack, dodge, wall jump, and special move.",
